  "help.contextMessages": "The maximum number of recent messages (user messages and assistant replies together) sent to the prediction model.",
  "help.targetInputTokens": "The size limit of one prediction's input: the fixed instructions (about 700 tokens) plus the conversation excerpt. What does not fit is trimmed, keeping the most recent content. A higher value raises the cost per prediction and sends more of the conversation.",
  "help.includeTurnFacts": "Appends one line of statistics for the last turn to the excerpt: the number of tool calls, file edits and test commands. No tool output or file content is included.",
  "help.redactSecrets": "Before sending, replaces what looks like a secret or a personal detail with a placeholder: private-key blocks, keys and tokens in known formats, values assigned to names such as password or secret, e-mail addresses, mainland-China mobile and ID numbers, and the user name inside home-folder paths. It works by rules and cannot guarantee that everything sensitive is found. When off, the excerpt is sent as is.",
  "help.maxSuggestionGraphemes": "A suggestion longer than this is discarded; it is never shown truncated.",
